| 2–4 | General MLE (×3, interchangeable) | `generalPurpose` | `/Users/harshmaheshwari/.cursor/org/roles/general-mle.md` |
| 5 | Run Triage & Debugger | `generalPurpose` | `/Users/harshmaheshwari/.cursor/org/roles/run-triage-debugger.md` |

